/* web: details/machine/machineInventoryBody.module.css の .processRow（grid 1fr auto 1fr・column-gap 16px）・.inputSide のつまみ上書き・モジュール帯の mt=xs・style.module.css の .fillPanelHeight と .machineInventoryScroll を機械の区画に写す / ports the process row grid, the input-side knob overrides, the module band's mt=xs, fillPanelHeight and machineInventoryScroll */
.machine-section--fill-panel-height {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    min-height: 0;
}

/* Mantine ScrollArea（scrollbars 既定 xy）の縦バーは bottom: var(--sa-corner-width)。角の幅は縦バーの幅 12px（横バーが無くても入る。前例 ItemList.uss） */
/* Mantine ScrollArea (default scrollbars xy) puts the vertical bar at bottom: var(--sa-corner-width); the corner is the bar's 12px width even with no horizontal bar (precedent ItemList.uss) */
.machine-section__inventory-scroll {
    --game-scroll-view-scrollbar-inset-bottom: var(--scrollarea-scrollbar-size);
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    min-height: 0;
}

/* grid の 1fr auto 1fr は左右を等幅の伸縮列にして矢印を中央に固定する（UITK に grid が無い）。基準の幅と最小幅は MachineProcessRow が中身から当てる */
/* grid 1fr auto 1fr becomes two equal stretching sides that pin the arrow at the centre (UITK has no grid); MachineProcessRow sets the basis and floor from the content */
.machine-process-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
}

.machine-process-row__input {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-right: 16px;
    --shortage-count-right: 2px;
    --shortage-count-bottom: -3px;
    --shortage-count-font-size: 15px;
}

.machine-process-row__output {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-left: 16px;
}

/* 矢印は Web の auto の列で中身の幅のまま。左右が縮むときも潰れない */
/* The arrow is the Web auto column and stays content-wide, never squeezed when the sides shrink */
.machine-process-row > .progress-arrow-glyph {
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Web の grid の項目は min-width: auto で中身より縮まない。帯の格子を縮めず、測った幅を各側の min-width にする（MachineProcessRow） */
/* Web grid items keep min-width: auto and never shrink below content; keep the band grids unshrunk so their measured width feeds each side's min-width (MachineProcessRow) */
.machine-process-row__input > *,
.machine-process-row__output > * {
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* UiStack は子の marginTop を gap で上書きするので、mt=xs は器の内側の余白で写す */
/* UiStack overwrites a child's marginTop with the gap, so mt=xs is ported as the box's inner padding */
.machine-module-band-wrap {
    padding-top: var(--mantine-spacing-xs);
}
